15 0 obj
<< /A 36 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating a data-driven system. On the left, colorful circles represent data sources: laboratory data, EMA self-report, biosensors, passive data, and ambient sensors. A Venn diagram shows overlap between these data types. In the center, a prediction model is divided into nomothetic and individualized sections, depicting population modeling, sub-group prediction, and personalized time-series models. On the right, a decision rules flowchart outlines a feedback loop involving risk estimation, context-aware rating systems, and intervention delivery based on maximum weight, concluding with user feedback.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
